   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "受控执行"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "针对 AI 生成软件的受控执行。"
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud 是 AI 生成软件执行环境的身份与部署控制入口。Kotoba 是语言。Kotobase 是可信图状态层。安全的代码。可信的状态。受控的执行。Kotoba Labs 正在构建一个安全且超快的软件栈，将这三者连接起来。"
   "Start with a Base Account" "从 Base Account 开始"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "探索 Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "AI 智能体快速入门"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "发现功能和 Passkey RP 已上线。托管应用功能尚未提供。"
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "Passkey 用户名"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "稳定 Principal"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "活动控制器"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "三个执行平面。边界完整。"
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "这些服务相互连接，但不会成为一个巨大的信任域。每个权限实体都保持独立治理。"
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "控制 + 身份"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey 验证稳定 Principal。控制平面发布 CLI 部署所使用的拓扑结构和权限下限。"
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "存储"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "用于 AI 状态和知识的基于内容寻址的图数据库，具有明确的关系和可识别的历史记录。"
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "连接此 Principal →"
