   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "一个发布 CID，可从多个提供商执行"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "发布 CID 在一个 IPLD 图中固定了命名空间头、定义、原始 Wasm、编译收据以及可复现性证据。名称和 GitHub 仅用于发现和溯源。"
   "Bundle" "捆绑"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "在一个发布 CID 下封闭定义、Wasm 工件和编译收据。"
   "Replicate" "复制"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "在至少两个独立的存储源中存储相同的完整闭包。"
   "Verify + Run" "验证 + 运行"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "验证每个字节和路由对等 ID，然后通过发布 CID 执行并导出。"
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "后量子签名是强制性的，而非可选的。发布需要 Passkey 会话以及固定到 Principal 的 ML-DSA-65 签名。外部身份验证器和分布式资格认证仍然是独立验证的边界。"
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "打开库目录和依赖图"
   "Approve library publication" "批准库发布"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI 已在本地对该图进行签名并存储在 Kotobase 中。发布前请验证 CID 和 IPNS 名称。"
   "Namespace" "命名空间"
   "Release CID" "发布 CID"
   "Head record CID" "头记录 CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS 名称"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "使用 Passkey + ML-DSA-65 发布"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "批准后量子密钥过渡"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "验证操作、纪元、当前密钥和下一密钥。轮换由两个 ML-DSA 密钥签名，仅在 Passkey 确认后生效。"
   "Action" "操作"
   "Expected epoch" "预期纪元"
   "Current key" "当前密钥"
   "Next key" "下一密钥"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "使用 Passkey 确认密钥过渡"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "从 AI 编写的代码到被接纳的计算"
   "Write" "编写"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "代理和人类可以自由地编写可读的、面向数据的代码。"
   "Admit" "接纳"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba 检查类型、效果、能力、资源和目标支持。"
   "Bind" "绑定"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "主机和提供商绑定 Passkey 身份和资源范围的授权。"
   "Run" "运行"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase 保留工件和收据；Murakumo 和 Itonami 执行被接纳的工作。"
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "边界使连接成为可能。"
   "Discovery is not delegation" "发现不是委托"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud 使每个源可被发现，而无需将存储、计算和代理工作合并到一个信任域中。收据单独记录每个源。"
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "现有的 auth.kotobase.net Passkey 不会自动迁移。新的 RP 需要已验证的 Principal 链接。"
   "Machine-readable profile" "机器可读配置文件"
   "Read the language specification" "阅读语言规范"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — 身份和部署控制"
   "LLM docs" "LLM 文档"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "语言：kotoba-lang.org · 存储：kotobase.net · 计算：murakumo.cloud · 代理工作：itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "运营商：Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "联系方式："
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "运营者"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "指定商业交易通知"}
  :arz {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — تنفيذ متحكم فيه للبرمجيات اللي بتتولد بالذكاء الاصطناعي"
   "Skip to content" "روح للمحتوى"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "الهندسة المعمارية"
   "Publish libraries" "انشر المكتبات"
   "Language" "اللغة"
   "English" "إنجليزي"
   "Español" "إسباني"
   "Français" "فرنساوي"
   "Português" "برتغالي"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "بهاسا إندونيسيا"
   "Deutsch" "ألماني"
   "Naijá" "نايجا"
   "Sign in" "سجل دخول"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "تنفيذ متحكم فيه"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "تنفيذ متحكم فيه للبرمجيات اللي بتتولد بالذكاء الاصطناعي."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud هو مدخل الهوية والتحكم في النشر لبيئة تنفيذ البرمجيات اللي بتتولد بالذكاء الاصطناعي. Kotoba هي اللغة. Kotobase هي طبقة حالة الرسم البياني الموثوق بيها. كود آمن. حالة موثوق بيها. تنفيذ متحكم فيه. Kotoba Labs شغالة على بناء ستاك برمجيات آمن وسريع جداً بيربط التلاتة دول."
   "Start with a Base Account" "ابدأ بـ Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "استكشف Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "بدء سريع لوكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "الاكتشاف و Passkey RP شغالين. التطبيق المستضاف مش متوفر لسه."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "اسم مستخدم Passkey"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "المسؤول المستقر"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "المتحكم النشط"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "تلات مستويات تنفيذ. الحدود سليمة."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "الخدمات بتتصل من غير ما تبقى دومين ثقة واحد ضخم. كل سلطة بتفضل متحكمة فيها بشكل منفصل."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "التحكم + الهوية"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey بيأكد على Principal المستقر. لوحة التحكم بتنشر الطوبولوجي ومستوى السلطة اللي بيستخدمه CLI للنشر."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "التخزين"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "قاعدة بيانات رسم بياني موجهة بالمحتوى لحالة ومعرفة الذكاء الاصطناعي، بعلاقات واضحة وتاريخ معرف."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Connect this Principal →"
   "COMPUTE" "الحوسبة"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "بيحط الأحمال المسموح بيها على موارد CPU/GPU وبينفذها."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "شغل الوكيل"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "بيشغل شغل الوكيل المستمر عبر مساحات العمل، الأهداف، الأدوات، والموافقات."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "CID إصدار واحد، قابل للتنفيذ من أكتر من مزود"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "CID الإصدار بيثبت رأس مساحة الأسماء، التعريفات، Wasm الخام، إيصالات الترجمة، وأدلة إعادة الإنتاج في رسم IPLD واحد. الأسماء وGitHub بتفضل للاكتشاف والأصل."
   "Bundle" "الحزمة"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "اقفل التعريفات، قطع Wasm، وإيصالات الترجمة تحت CID إصدار واحد."
   "Replicate" "التكرار"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "خزن نفس الإغلاق الكامل في مصدرين تخزين مستقلين على الأقل."
   "Verify + Run" "التحقق + التشغيل"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "تحقق من كل بايت ومعرفات الأقران الموجهة، بعدين نفذ حسب CID الإصدار وصدّر."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "التواقيع بعد الكمومية ضرورية، مش اختيارية. النشر محتاج جلسة Passkey وتوقيع ML-DSA-65 مربوط بـ Principal. المصادقين الخارجيين والتأهيل الموزع لسه بيتحقق منهم كحدود منفصلة."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "افتح كتالوج المكتبات ورسم الاعتماديات"
   "Approve library publication" "وافق على نشر المكتبة"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI وقع الرسم ده محلياً وخزنه في Kotobase. تحقق من CIDs واسم IPNS قبل النشر."
   "Namespace" "مساحة الاسم"
   "Release CID" "CID الإصدار"
   "Head record CID" "CID سجل الرأس"
   "IPNS name" "اسم IPNS"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "انشر بـ Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "وافق على انتقال المفتاح بعد الكم"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "اتأكد من الإجراء، الحقبة، المفتاح الحالي، والمفتاح الجاي. التدوير موقع عليه من مفتاحي ML-DSA وبيشتغل بس بعد تأكيد Passkey."
   "Action" "الإجراء"
   "Expected epoch" "الحقبة المتوقعة"
   "Current key" "المفتاح الحالي"
   "Next key" "المفتاح الجاي"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "أكد انتقال المفتاح بـ Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "من كود الذكاء الاصطناعي لحسابات مسموح بتشغيلها"
   "Write" "اكتب"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "الوكلاء والبشر بيكتبوا بحرية بكود قابل للقراءة وموجه للبيانات."
   "Admit" "اسمح بالتشغيل"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba بتشيك الأنواع، التأثيرات، القدرات، الموارد، ودعم الهدف."
   "Bind" "اربط"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "المضيف والمزود بيربطوا هوية Passkey ومنحة محددة بالموارد."
   "Run" "شغل"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase بيحتفظ بالملفات الناتجة والإيصالات؛ Murakumo وItonami بينفذوا الشغل المسموح بيه."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "الحدود بتخلي الاتصال ممكن."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "الاكتشاف مش تفويض"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud بيخلي كل أصل قابل للاكتشاف من غير دمج التخزين، الحوسبة، وشغل الوكلاء في دومين ثقة واحد. الإيصالات بتسجل كل أصل لوحده."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Passkeys الموجودة على auth.kotobase.net مش بتتنقل تلقائياً. الـ RP الجديد محتاج رابط Principal موثق."
   "Machine-readable profile" "بروفايل قابل للقراءة آلياً"
   "Read the language specification" "اقرأ مواصفات اللغة"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — الهوية والتحكم في النشر"
   "LLM docs" "مستندات LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "اللغة: kotoba-lang.org · التخزين: kotobase.net · الحوسبة: murakumo.cloud · شغل الوكلاء: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "المشغل: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "تواصل:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "المشغل"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "إشعار المعاملات التجارية المحددة"}
  :id {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — eksekusi terkontrol untuk perangkat lunak yang dihasilkan AI"
   "Skip to content" "Lewati ke konten"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Arsitektur"
   "Publish libraries" "Terbitkan perpustakaan"
   "Language" "Bahasa"
   "English" "English"
   "Español" "Español"
   "Français" "Français"
   "Português" "Português"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "Bahasa Indonesia"
   "Deutsch" "Deutsch"
   "Naijá" "Naijá"
   "Sign in" "Masuk"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "EKSEKUSI TERKONTROL"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Eksekusi terkontrol untuk perangkat lunak yang dihasilkan AI."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud adalah pintu masuk identitas dan kontrol penyebaran ke lingkungan eksekusi untuk perangkat lunak yang dihasilkan AI. Kotoba adalah bahasanya. Kotobase adalah lapisan status grafik terpercaya. Kode aman. Status terpercaya. Eksekusi terkontrol. Kotoba Labs sedang membangun tumpukan perangkat lunak yang aman dan sangat cepat yang menghubungkan ketiganya."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Mulai dengan Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Jelajahi Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Mulai cepat agen AI"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery dan Passkey RP sudah aktif. Hosted apply belum tersedia."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "NAMA PENGGUNA PASSKEY"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "PRINSIPAL STABIL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "KONTROLER AKTIF"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Tiga bidang eksekusi. Batas tetap utuh."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Layanan terhubung tanpa menjadi satu domain kepercayaan raksasa. Setiap otoritas tetap diatur secara terpisah."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "KONTROL + IDENTITAS"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey memverifikasi Stable Principal. Bidang kontrol menerbitkan topologi dan lantai otoritas yang digunakan oleh penyebaran CLI."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "PENYIMPANAN"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Basis data grafik beralamat konten untuk status dan pengetahuan AI, dengan hubungan eksplisit dan riwayat yang dapat diidentifikasi."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Hubungkan Principal ini →"
   "COMPUTE" "KOMPUTASI"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Menempatkan beban kerja yang diterima pada sumber daya CPU/GPU dan mengeksekusinya."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "KERJA AGEN"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Menjalankan pekerjaan agen berkelanjutan di berbagai ruang kerja, tujuan, alat, dan persetujuan."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Satu CID rilis, dapat dieksekusi dari beberapa penyedia"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "CID rilis memperbaiki kepala namespace, definisi, Wasm mentah, tanda terima kompilasi, dan bukti reproduktibilitas dalam satu grafik IPLD. Nama dan GitHub tetap menjadi penemuan dan asal-usul."
   "Bundle" "Bundel"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Tutup definisi, artefak Wasm, dan tanda terima kompilasi di bawah satu CID rilis."
   "Replicate" "Replikasi"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Simpan penutupan lengkap yang sama di tidak kurang dari dua asal penyimpanan independen."
   "Verify + Run" "Verifikasi + Jalankan"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Verifikasi setiap byte dan ID peer yang diarahkan, lalu eksekusi berdasarkan CID rilis dan ekspor."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Tanda tangan pasca-kuantum wajib, bukan opsional. Publikasi memerlukan sesi Passkey dan tanda tangan ML-DSA-65 yang dipasang pada Principal. Autentikator eksternal dan kualifikasi terdistribusi tetap menjadi batas yang diverifikasi secara terpisah."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Buka katalog perpustakaan dan grafik ketergantungan"
   "Approve library publication" "Setujui publikasi perpustakaan"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI menandatangani grafik ini secara lokal dan menyimpannya di Kotobase. Verifikasi CID dan nama IPNS sebelum menerbitkan."
   "Namespace" "Namespace"
   "Release CID" "CID Rilis"
   "Head record CID" "CID catatan kepala"
   "IPNS name" "Nama IPNS"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Terbitkan dengan Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Setujui transisi kunci pasca-kuantum"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Verifikasi tindakan, epoch, kunci saat ini, dan kunci berikutnya. Rotasi ditandatangani oleh kedua kunci ML-DSA dan berlaku hanya setelah konfirmasi Passkey."
   "Action" "Tindakan"
   "Expected epoch" "Epoch yang diharapkan"
   "Current key" "Kunci saat ini"
   "Next key" "Kunci berikutnya"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Konfirmasi transisi kunci dengan Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "Dari kode yang ditulis AI ke komputasi yang diakui"
   "Write" "Tulis"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agen dan manusia menulis secara bebas dalam kode yang dapat dibaca dan berorientasi data."
   "Admit" "Akui"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba memeriksa tipe, efek, kapabilitas, sumber daya, dan dukungan target."
   "Bind" "Ikat"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Host dan penyedia mengikat identitas Passkey dan pemberian sumber daya yang dibatasi."
   "Run" "Jalankan"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase menyimpan artefak dan tanda terima; Murakumo dan Itonami melakukan pekerjaan yang diakui."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Batas memungkinkan koneksi."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Penemuan bukan delegasi"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud membuat setiap asal dapat ditemukan tanpa menggabungkan penyimpanan, komputasi, dan pekerjaan agen ke dalam satu domain kepercayaan. Tanda terima mencatat setiap asal secara terpisah."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Passkey auth.kotobase.net yang ada tidak bermigrasi secara otomatis. RP baru memerlukan tautan Principal yang terverifikasi."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Profil yang dapat dibaca mesin"
   "Read the language specification" "Baca spesifikasi bahasa"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — kontrol identitas dan penyebaran"
   "LLM docs" "Dokumen LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Bahasa: kotoba-lang.org · Penyimpanan: kotobase.net · Komputasi: murakumo.cloud · Pekerjaan agen: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Kontak:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Operator"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Pemberitahuan Transaksi Komersial yang Ditentukan"}
