   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "제어된 실행"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "AI 생성 소프트웨어를 위한 제어된 실행."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud는 AI 생성 소프트웨어 실행 환경에 대한 신원 및 배포 제어 입구입니다. Kotoba는 언어입니다. Kotobase는 신뢰할 수 있는 그래프 상태 계층입니다. 안전한 코드. 신뢰할 수 있는 상태. 제어된 실행. Kotoba Labs는 이 세 가지를 연결하는 안전하고 초고속 소프트웨어 스택을 구축하고 있습니다."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Base Account로 시작하세요"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Kotoba CLI 탐색"
   "AI agent quickstart" "AI 에이전트 빠른 시작"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery와 Passkey RP는 활성화되어 있습니다. 호스팅된 적용은 아직 제공되지 않습니다."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "PASSKEY 사용자 이름"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "안정적인 Principal"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "활성 컨트롤러"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "세 가지 실행 평면. 경계 유지."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "서비스들은 하나의 거대한 신뢰 도메인이 되지 않고 연결됩니다. 각 권한은 별도로 관리됩니다."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "제어 + 신원"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey는 안정적인 Principal을 검증합니다. 제어 평면은 CLI 배포에 사용되는 토폴로지와 권한 층을 게시합니다."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "저장소"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "명시적 관계와 식별 가능한 이력을 가진 AI 상태 및 지식을 위한 콘텐츠 주소 지정 그래프 데이터베이스입니다."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "이 Principal 연결 →"
   "COMPUTE" "컴퓨트"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "허용된 작업 부하를 CPU/GPU 자원에 배치하고 실행합니다."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "에이전트 작업"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "작업 공간, 목표, 도구 및 승인을 넘나드는 지속적인 에이전트 작업을 실행합니다."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "여러 공급자에서 실행 가능한 단일 릴리스 CID"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "릴리스 CID는 네임스페이스 헤드, 정의, 원시 Wasm, 컴파일 영수증 및 재현 가능성 증거를 하나의 IPLD 그래프에 고정합니다. 이름과 GitHub는 발견 및 출처로 남아 있습니다."
   "Bundle" "번들"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "정의, Wasm 아티팩트 및 컴파일 영수증을 하나의 릴리스 CID 아래에 묶습니다."
   "Replicate" "복제"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "동일한 완전한 클로저를 두 개 이상의 독립 저장소 출처에 저장합니다."
   "Verify + Run" "검증 + 실행"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "모든 바이트와 라우팅된 피어 ID를 검증한 후 릴리스 CID로 실행하고 내보냅니다."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "포스트 양자 서명은 선택이 아닌 필수입니다. 게시에는 Passkey 세션과 Principal에 고정된 ML-DSA-65 서명이 모두 필요합니다. 외부 인증자 및 분산 자격 검증은 별도의 검증 경계로 유지됩니다."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "라이브러리 카탈로그 및 의존성 그래프 열기"
   "Approve library publication" "라이브러리 게시 승인"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI가 이 그래프에 로컬 서명하고 Kotobase에 저장했습니다. 게시 전에 CID와 IPNS 이름을 검증하세요."
   "Namespace" "네임스페이스"
   "Release CID" "릴리스 CID"
   "Head record CID" "헤드 레코드 CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS 이름"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Passkey + ML-DSA-65로 게시"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "포스트 양자 키 전환 승인"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "동작, 에포크, 현재 키 및 다음 키를 검증합니다. 회전은 두 ML-DSA 키 모두에 의해 서명되며 Passkey 확인 후에만 적용됩니다."
   "Action" "동작"
   "Expected epoch" "예상 에포크"
   "Current key" "현재 키"
   "Next key" "다음 키"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Passkey로 키 전환 확인"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "AI 작성 코드에서 승인된 계산으로"
   "Write" "작성"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "에이전트와 사람이 읽기 쉽고 데이터 지향적인 코드로 자유롭게 작성합니다."
   "Admit" "승인"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba는 타입, 효과, 권한, 자원 및 대상 지원을 검사합니다."
   "Bind" "바인딩"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "호스트와 제공자는 Passkey 신원과 자원 범위 부여를 바인딩합니다."
   "Run" "실행"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase는 산출물과 영수증을 보관하며; Murakumo와 Itonami가 승인된 작업을 수행합니다."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "경계가 연결을 가능하게 합니다."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "발견은 위임이 아닙니다"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud는 저장소, 컴퓨트, 에이전트 작업을 하나의 신뢰 도메인으로 병합하지 않고 각 출처를 발견 가능하게 합니다. 영수증은 각 출처를 별도로 기록합니다."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "기존 auth.kotobase.net Passkey는 자동으로 이전되지 않습니다. 새 RP는 검증된 Principal 링크를 요구합니다."
   "Machine-readable profile" "기계 판독 프로필"
   "Read the language specification" "언어 사양 읽기"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — 신원 및 배포 제어"
   "LLM docs" "LLM 문서"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "언어: kotoba-lang.org · 저장소: kotobase.net · 컴퓨트: murakumo.cloud · 에이전트 작업: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "운영자: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "문의:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "운영자"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "특정 상거래 거래 고지"}
  :fr {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — exécution contrôlée pour les logiciels générés par IA"
   "Skip to content" "Passer au contenu"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Architecture"
   "Publish libraries" "Publier des bibliothèques"
   "Language" "Langue"
   "English" "English"
   "Español" "Español"
   "Français" "Français"
   "Português" "Português"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "Bahasa Indonesia"
   "Deutsch" "Deutsch"
   "Naijá" "Naijá"
   "Sign in" "Se connecter"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "EXÉCUTION CONTRÔLÉE"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Exécution contrôlée pour les logiciels générés par IA."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud est la porte d'entrée d'identité et de contrôle de déploiement vers l'environnement d'exécution pour les logiciels générés par IA. Kotoba est le langage. Kotobase est la couche d'état de graphe de confiance. Code sûr. État de confiance. Exécution contrôlée. Kotoba Labs construit une pile logicielle sûre et ultra-rapide qui connecte les trois."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Commencez avec un Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Explorer le CLI Kotoba"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Démarrage rapide de l'agent IA"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "La découverte et le Passkey RP sont en ligne. L'application hébergée n'est pas encore disponible."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "NOM D'UTILISATEUR PASSKEY"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "PRINCIPAL STABLE"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "CONTROLEUR ACTIF"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Trois plans d'exécution. Frontières intactes."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Les services se connectent sans devenir un gigantesque domaine de confiance. Chaque autorité reste gouvernée séparément."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "CONTRÔLE + IDENTITÉ"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey vérifie un Principal Stable. Le plan de contrôle publie la topologie et le niveau d'autorité utilisés par le déploiement CLI."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "STOCKAGE"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Une base de données graphe adressée par contenu pour l'état et la connaissance IA, avec des relations explicites et un historique identifiable."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Connecter ce Principal →"
   "COMPUTE" "CALCUL"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Place les charges de travail admises sur les ressources CPU/GPU et les exécute."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "TRAVAIL D'AGENT"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Exécute le travail continu d'agent à travers espaces de travail, objectifs, outils et approbations."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Un CID de version, exécutable depuis plusieurs fournisseurs"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "Un CID de version fixe la tête de l'espace de noms, les définitions, le Wasm brut, les reçus de compilation et les preuves de reproductibilité dans un seul graphe IPLD. Les noms et GitHub restent la découverte et la provenance."
   "Bundle" "Regrouper"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Fermer les définitions, artefacts Wasm et reçus de compilation sous un seul CID de version."
   "Replicate" "Répliquer"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Stocker la même clôture complète sur au moins deux origines de stockage indépendantes."
   "Verify + Run" "Vérifier + Exécuter"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Vérifier chaque octet et les ID pairs routés, puis exécuter par CID de version et exporter."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Les signatures post-quantiques sont obligatoires, non optionnelles. La publication nécessite à la fois une session Passkey et une signature ML-DSA-65 attachée au Principal. Les authentificateurs externes et la qualification distribuée restent des frontières vérifiées séparément."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Ouvrir le catalogue de bibliothèques et le graphe de dépendances"
   "Approve library publication" "Approuver la publication de la bibliothèque"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "Le CLI a signé ce graphe localement et l'a stocké dans Kotobase. Vérifiez les CIDs et le nom IPNS avant de publier."
   "Namespace" "Espace de noms"
   "Release CID" "CID de version"
   "Head record CID" "CID d'enregistrement de tête"
   "IPNS name" "Nom IPNS"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Publier avec Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Approuver la transition de clé post-quantique"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Vérifiez l'action, l'époque, la clé actuelle et la clé suivante. La rotation est signée par les deux clés ML-DSA et ne prend effet qu'après confirmation par Passkey."
   "Action" "Action"
   "Expected epoch" "Époque attendue"
   "Current key" "Clé actuelle"
   "Next key" "Clé suivante"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Confirmer la transition de clé avec Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "Du code écrit par IA au calcul admis"
   "Write" "Écrire"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Les agents et les humains écrivent librement dans un code lisible et orienté données."
   "Admit" "Admettre"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba vérifie les types, effets, capacités, ressources et support cible."
   "Bind" "Lier"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "L’hôte et le fournisseur lient l’identité Passkey et une autorisation limitée aux ressources."
   "Run" "Exécuter"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase conserve les artefacts et reçus ; Murakumo et Itonami réalisent le travail admis."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Les frontières rendent la connexion possible."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "La découverte n’est pas une délégation"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud rend chaque origine découvrable sans fusionner stockage, calcul et travail d’agent en un seul domaine de confiance. Les reçus enregistrent chaque origine séparément."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Les Passkeys existants auth.kotobase.net ne migrent pas automatiquement. Le nouveau RP requiert un lien Principal vérifié."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Profil lisible par machine"
   "Read the language specification" "Lire la spécification du langage"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — contrôle d’identité et de déploiement"
   "LLM docs" "Docs LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Langage : kotoba-lang.org · Stockage : kotobase.net · Calcul : murakumo.cloud · Travail d’agent : itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Opérateur : Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Contact :"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Opérateur"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Avis sur les transactions commerciales spécifiées"}
  :pt {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — execução controlada para software gerado por IA"
   "Skip to content" "Ir para o conteúdo"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Arquitetura"
   "Publish libraries" "Publicar bibliotecas"
   "Language" "Idioma"
   "English" "English"
   "Español" "Español"
   "Français" "Français"
   "Português" "Português"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "Bahasa Indonesia"
   "Deutsch" "Deutsch"
   "Naijá" "Naijá"
   "Sign in" "Entrar"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "EXECUÇÃO CONTROLADA"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Execução controlada para software gerado por IA."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud é a entrada de identidade e controle de implantação para o ambiente de execução de software gerado por IA. Kotoba é a linguagem. Kotobase é a camada confiável de estado em grafo. Código seguro. Estado confiável. Execução controlada. Kotoba Labs está construindo uma pilha de software segura e ultrarrápida que conecta os três."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Comece com uma Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Explore o Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Início rápido do agente de IA"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery e o Passkey RP estão ativos. Aplicação hospedada ainda não está disponível."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "NOME DE USUÁRIO PASSKEY"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "PRINCIPAL ESTÁVEL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "CONTROLADOR ATIVO"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Três planos de execução. Limites intactos."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Os serviços se conectam sem se tornarem um grande domínio de confiança. Cada autoridade permanece governada separadamente."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "CONTROLE + IDENTIDADE"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey verifica um Principal Estável. O plano de controle publica a topologia e o piso de autoridade usados pela implantação CLI."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "ARMAZENAMENTO"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Um banco de dados em grafo endereçado por conteúdo para estado e conhecimento de IA, com relacionamentos explícitos e histórico identificável."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Conectar este Principal →"
   "COMPUTE" "CÁLCULO"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Coloca cargas de trabalho admitidas em recursos CPU/GPU e as executa."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "TRABALHO DE AGENTE"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Executa trabalho contínuo de agente através de espaços de trabalho, metas, ferramentas e aprovações."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Um CID de release, executável por múltiplos provedores"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "Um CID de release fixa o cabeçalho do namespace, definições, Wasm bruto, recibos de compilação e evidência de reprodutibilidade em um único grafo IPLD. Nomes e GitHub permanecem para descoberta e proveniência."
   "Bundle" "Pacote"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Feche definições, artefatos Wasm e recibos de compilação sob um único CID de release."
   "Replicate" "Replicar"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Armazene o mesmo fechamento completo em no mínimo duas origens de armazenamento independentes."
   "Verify + Run" "Verificar + Executar"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Verifique cada byte e IDs de pares roteados, então execute pelo CID de release e exporte."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Assinaturas pós-quânticas são obrigatórias, não opcionais. A publicação requer tanto uma sessão Passkey quanto uma assinatura ML-DSA-65 vinculada ao Principal. Autenticadores externos e qualificação distribuída permanecem limites verificados separadamente."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Abra o catálogo de bibliotecas e o grafo de dependências"
   "Approve library publication" "Aprovar publicação da biblioteca"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "O CLI assinou este grafo localmente e o armazenou no Kotobase. Verifique os CIDs e o nome IPNS antes de publicar."
   "Namespace" "Namespace"
   "Release CID" "CID de release"
   "Head record CID" "CID do registro principal"
   "IPNS name" "Nome IPNS"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Publicar com Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Aprovar transição de chave pós-quântica"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Verifique a ação, época, chave atual e próxima chave. A rotação é assinada por ambas as chaves ML-DSA e só entra em vigor após confirmação do Passkey."
   "Action" "Ação"
   "Expected epoch" "Época esperada"
   "Current key" "Chave atual"
   "Next key" "Próxima chave"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Confirmar transição de chave com Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "De código escrito por IA para computação admitida"
   "Write" "Escrever"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agentes e humanos escrevem livremente em código legível e orientado a dados."
   "Admit" "Admitir"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba verifica tipos, efeitos, capacidades, recursos e suporte ao alvo."
   "Bind" "Vincular"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "O host e o provedor vinculam a identidade Passkey e uma concessão com escopo de recurso."
   "Run" "Executar"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase mantém artefatos e recibos; Murakumo e Itonami realizam o trabalho admitido."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Fronteiras tornam a conexão possível."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Descoberta não é delegação"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud torna cada origem descobrível sem fundir armazenamento, computação e trabalho de agente em um único domínio de confiança. Recibos registram cada origem separadamente."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Passkeys existentes em auth.kotobase.net não migram automaticamente. O novo RP requer um link Principal verificado."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Perfil legível por máquina"
   "Read the language specification" "Leia a especificação da linguagem"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — controle de identidade e implantação"
   "LLM docs" "Documentos LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Linguagem: kotoba-lang.org · Armazenamento: kotobase.net · Computação: murakumo.cloud · Trabalho de agente: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Operador: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Contato:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Operador"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Aviso de Transações Comerciais Especificadas"}
  :de {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — kontrollierte Ausführung für KI-generierte Software"
   "Skip to content" "Zum Inhalt springen"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Architektur"
   "Publish libraries" "Bibliotheken veröffentlichen"
   "Language" "Sprache"
   "English" "Englisch"
   "Español" "Spanisch"
   "Français" "Französisch"
   "Português" "Portugiesisch"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "Bahasa Indonesia"
   "Deutsch" "Deutsch"
   "Naijá" "Naijá"
   "Sign in" "Anmelden"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "KONTROLLIERTE AUSFÜHRUNG"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Kontrollierte Ausführung für KI-generierte Software."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud ist der Identitäts- und Deploy-Kontrollzugang zur Ausführungsumgebung für KI-generierte Software. Kotoba ist die Sprache. Kotobase ist die vertrauenswürdige Graph-Zustandsschicht. Sicherer Code. Vertrauenswürdiger Zustand. Kontrollierte Ausführung. Kotoba Labs arbeitet an einem sicheren und ultraschnellen Software-Stack, der alle drei verbindet."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Beginnen Sie mit einem Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Erkunden Sie die Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Schnellstart für KI-Agenten"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery und der Passkey RP sind live. Gehostetes Anwenden ist noch nicht verfügbar."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "PASSKEY BENUTZERNAME"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "STABILER PRINCIPAL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "AKTIVER CONTROLLER"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Drei Ausführungsebenen. Grenzen intakt."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Die Dienste verbinden sich, ohne eine riesige Vertrauensdomäne zu bilden. Jede Autorität bleibt separat verwaltet."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "KONTROLLE + IDENTITÄT"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey verifiziert einen Stabilen Principal. Die Kontroll-Ebene veröffentlicht die Topologie und die Autoritätsebene, die vom CLI-Deploy verwendet wird."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "SPEICHER"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Eine inhaltsadressierte Graphdatenbank für KI-Zustand und Wissen, mit expliziten Beziehungen und identifizierbarer Historie."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Diesen Principal verbinden →"
   "COMPUTE" "RECHENLEISTUNG"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Platziert zugelassene Arbeitslasten auf CPU/GPU-Ressourcen und führt sie aus."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "AGENTENARBEIT"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Führt fortlaufende Agentenarbeit über Arbeitsbereiche, Ziele, Werkzeuge und Genehmigungen aus."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Eine Release CID, ausführbar von mehreren Anbietern"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "Eine Release CID fixiert den Namespace-Kopf, Definitionen, rohe Wasm, Kompilierungsbelege und Reproduzierbarkeitsnachweise in einem IPLD-Graphen. Namen und GitHub bleiben für Discovery und Herkunft."
   "Bundle" "Bündel"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Schließen Sie Definitionen, Wasm-Artefakte und Kompilierungsbelege unter einer Release CID zusammen."
   "Replicate" "Replizieren"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Speichern Sie denselben vollständigen Abschluss an mindestens zwei unabhängigen Speicherorten."
   "Verify + Run" "Verifizieren + Ausführen"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Verifizieren Sie jedes Byte und geroutete Peer-IDs, dann ausführen nach Release CID und exportieren."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Post-quantensichere Signaturen sind verpflichtend, nicht optional. Die Veröffentlichung erfordert sowohl eine Passkey-Sitzung als auch eine ML-DSA-65-Signatur, die am Principal befestigt ist. Externe Authentifikatoren und verteilte Qualifikationen bleiben separat verifizierte Grenzen."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Öffnen Sie den Bibliothekskatalog und den Abhängigkeitsgraphen"
   "Approve library publication" "Bibliotheksveröffentlichung genehmigen"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "Die CLI hat diesen Graph lokal signiert und in Kotobase gespeichert. Verifizieren Sie die CIDs und den IPNS-Namen vor der Veröffentlichung."
   "Namespace" "Namespace"
   "Release CID" "Release CID"
   "Head record CID" "Head Record CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS-Name"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Veröffentlichen mit Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Post-quantum Schlüsselübergang genehmigen"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Überprüfen Sie die Aktion, Epoche, den aktuellen Schlüssel und den nächsten Schlüssel. Die Rotation wird von beiden ML-DSA-Schlüsseln signiert und tritt erst nach Passkey-Bestätigung in Kraft."
   "Action" "Aktion"
   "Expected epoch" "Erwartete Epoche"
   "Current key" "Aktueller Schlüssel"
   "Next key" "Nächster Schlüssel"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Schlüsselübergang mit Passkey bestätigen"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "Vom KI-generierten Code zur zugelassenen Berechnung"
   "Write" "Schreiben"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agenten und Menschen schreiben frei in lesbarem, datenorientiertem Code."
   "Admit" "Zulassen"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba prüft Typen, Effekte, Fähigkeiten, Ressourcen und Zielunterstützung."
   "Bind" "Binden"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Der Host und Anbieter binden Passkey-Identität und eine ressourcenbeschränkte Berechtigung."
   "Run" "Ausführen"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase speichert Artefakte und Belege; Murakumo und Itonami führen die zugelassene Arbeit aus."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Grenzen ermöglichen Verbindung."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Entdeckung ist keine Delegation"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud macht jede Origin auffindbar, ohne Speicher, Berechnung und Agentenarbeit zu einer Vertrauensdomäne zu verschmelzen. Belege zeichnen jede Origin separat auf."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Bestehende auth.kotobase.net Passkeys migrieren nicht automatisch. Der neue RP erfordert einen verifizierten Principal-Link."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Maschinenlesbares Profil"
   "Read the language specification" "Lesen Sie die Sprachspezifikation"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — Identitäts- und Bereitstellungskontrolle"
   "LLM docs" "LLM-Dokumentation"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Sprache: kotoba-lang.org · Speicher: kotobase.net · Berechnung: murakumo.cloud · Agentenarbeit: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Betreiber: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Kontakt:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Betreiber"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Hinweis zu den angegebenen gewerblichen Transaktionen"}
  :ru {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — контролируемое выполнение для программного обеспечения, сгенерированного ИИ"
   "Skip to content" "Перейти к содержимому"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Архитектура"
   "Publish libraries" "Публиковать библиотеки"
   "Language" "Язык"
   "English" "Английский"
   "Español" "Испанский"
   "Français" "Французский"
   "Português" "Португальский"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "Бахаса Индонезия"
   "Deutsch" "Немецкий"
   "Naijá" "Наиджа"
   "Sign in" "Войти"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "КОНТРОЛИРУЕМОЕ ВЫПОЛНЕНИЕ"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Контролируемое выполнение для программного обеспечения, сгенерированного ИИ."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud — это вход в среду выполнения для программного обеспечения, сгенерированного ИИ, с контролем идентичности и развертывания. Kotoba — это язык. Kotobase — доверенный слой графового состояния. Безопасный код. Доверенное состояние. Контролируемое выполнение. Kotoba Labs создаёт безопасный и сверхбыстрый программный стек, который объединяет все три."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Начните с Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Изучить Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Быстрый старт агента ИИ"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery и Passkey RP уже работают. Хостинг apply пока недоступен."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "ИМЯ ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛЯ PASSKEY"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "СТАБИЛЬНЫЙ PRINCIPAL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "АКТИВНЫЙ КОНТРОЛЛЕР"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Три плоскости выполнения. Границы сохранены."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Сервисы соединяются, не превращаясь в одну гигантскую область доверия. Каждая власть остаётся отдельно управляемой."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "КОНТРОЛЬ + ИДЕНТИЧНОСТЬ"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey подтверждает Stable Principal. Плоскость управления публикует топологию и уровень полномочий, используемые CLI для развертывания."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "ХРАНЕНИЕ"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Графовая база данных с адресацией по содержимому для состояния и знаний ИИ, с явными связями и идентифицируемой историей."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Подключить этот Principal →"
   "COMPUTE" "ВЫЧИСЛЕНИЯ"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Размещает допущенные рабочие нагрузки на CPU/GPU ресурсах и выполняет их."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "РАБОТА АГЕНТА"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Выполняет непрерывную работу агента по рабочим пространствам, целям, инструментам и утверждениям."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Один CID релиза, исполняемый от нескольких провайдеров"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "CID релиза фиксирует голову пространства имён, определения, исходный Wasm, квитанции компиляции и доказательства воспроизводимости в одном IPLD графе. Имена и GitHub остаются для обнаружения и происхождения."
   "Bundle" "Пакет"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Закрыть определения, Wasm-артефакты и квитанции компиляции под одним CID релиза."
   "Replicate" "Реплицировать"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Хранить одну и ту же полную замкнутую структуру не менее чем в двух независимых источниках хранения."
   "Verify + Run" "Проверить + Запустить"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Проверить каждый байт и маршрутизированные идентификаторы пиров, затем выполнить по CID релиза и экспортировать."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Постквантовые подписи обязательны, не опциональны. Публикация требует как сессии Passkey, так и подписи ML-DSA-65, закреплённой за Principal. Внешние аутентификаторы и распределённая квалификация остаются отдельно проверяемыми границами."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Открыть каталог библиотек и граф зависимостей"
   "Approve library publication" "Одобрить публикацию библиотеки"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI подписал этот граф локально и сохранил его в Kotobase. Проверьте CIDs и имя IPNS перед публикацией."
   "Namespace" "Пространство имён"
   "Release CID" "CID релиза"
   "Head record CID" "CID записи головы"
   "IPNS name" "Имя IPNS"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Публикация с Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Подтвердить переход постквантового ключа"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Проверить действие, эпоху, текущий ключ и следующий ключ. Ротация подписывается обоими ключами ML-DSA и вступает в силу только после подтверждения Passkey."
   "Action" "Действие"
   "Expected epoch" "Ожидаемая эпоха"
   "Current key" "Текущий ключ"
   "Next key" "Следующий ключ"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Подтвердить переход ключа с Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "От кода, написанного ИИ, к принятому вычислению"
   "Write" "Писать"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Агенты и люди свободно пишут читаемый, ориентированный на данные код."
   "Admit" "Принять"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba проверяет типы, эффекты, возможности, ресурсы и поддержку цели."
   "Bind" "Связать"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Хост и провайдер связывают идентичность Passkey и грант с областью ресурсов."
   "Run" "Запустить"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase хранит артефакты и квитанции; Murakumo и Itonami выполняют принятое задание."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Границы делают возможным соединение."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Обнаружение — это не делегирование"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud делает каждый источник обнаруживаемым без слияния хранения, вычислений и работы агента в одну доверенную область. Квитанции записывают каждый источник отдельно."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Существующие Passkey с auth.kotobase.net не мигрируют автоматически. Новый RP требует проверенной ссылки Principal."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Машиночитаемый профиль"
   "Read the language specification" "Прочитать спецификацию языка"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — управление идентичностью и развертыванием"
   "LLM docs" "Документы LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Язык: kotoba-lang.org · Хранение: kotobase.net · Вычисления: murakumo.cloud · Работа агента: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Оператор: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Контакт:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Оператор"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Уведомление о специальных коммерческих сделках"}
  :ur {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — AI سے تیار کردہ سافٹ ویئر کے لیے کنٹرول شدہ عمل درآمد"
   "Skip to content" "مواد پر جائیں"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "معماری"
   "Publish libraries" "لائبریریاں شائع کریں"
   "Language" "زبان"
   "English" "انگریزی"
   "Español" "ہسپانوی"
   "Français" "فرانسیسی"
   "Português" "پرتگالی"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "بہاسا انڈونیشیا"
   "Deutsch" "جرمن"
   "Naijá" "نائجیریا"
   "Sign in" "سائن ان کریں"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "کنٹرول شدہ عمل درآمد"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "AI سے تیار کردہ سافٹ ویئر کے لیے کنٹرول شدہ عمل درآمد۔"
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud AI سے تیار کردہ سافٹ ویئر کے عمل درآمد کے ماحول تک شناخت اور تعیناتی کنٹرول کا دروازہ ہے۔ Kotoba زبان ہے۔ Kotobase قابل اعتماد گراف اسٹیٹ پرت ہے۔ محفوظ کوڈ۔ قابل اعتماد اسٹیٹ۔ کنٹرول شدہ عمل درآمد۔ Kotoba Labs ایک محفوظ اور انتہائی تیز سافٹ ویئر اسٹیک کی تعمیر کر رہا ہے جو تینوں کو جوڑتا ہے۔"
   "Start with a Base Account" "Base Account کے ساتھ شروع کریں"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Kotoba CLI دریافت کریں"
   "AI agent quickstart" "AI ایجنٹ فوری آغاز"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery اور Passkey RP فعال ہیں۔ Hosted apply ابھی دستیاب نہیں ہے۔"
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "PASSKEY یوزر نیم"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "STABLE PRINCIPAL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "ACTIVE CONTROLLER"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "تین عمل درآمد کے طیارے۔ حدود برقرار۔"
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "خدمات ایک دوسرے میں ضم ہوئے بغیر جڑی ہیں۔ ہر اتھارٹی الگ سے حکمرانی کرتی ہے۔"
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "کنٹرول + شناخت"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey ایک Stable Principal کی تصدیق کرتا ہے۔ کنٹرول پلین topology اور authority floor شائع کرتا ہے جو CLI deploy میں استعمال ہوتا ہے۔"
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "ذخیرہ"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "AI اسٹیٹ اور علم کے لیے ایک content-addressed گراف ڈیٹا بیس، جس میں واضح تعلقات اور شناختی تاریخ شامل ہے۔"
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "اس Principal کو جوڑیں →"
   "COMPUTE" "کمپیوٹ"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "CPU/GPU وسائل پر منظور شدہ ورک لوڈز کو رکھتا ہے اور انہیں چلاتا ہے۔"
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "ایجنٹ کا کام"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "ورک اسپیسز، اہداف، ٹولز، اور منظوریوں کے درمیان جاری ایجنٹ کام چلاتا ہے۔"
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "ایک ریلیز CID، متعدد فراہم کنندگان سے قابل عمل"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "ایک ریلیز CID namespace head، تعریفات، raw Wasm، compile receipts، اور reproducibility evidence کو ایک IPLD گراف میں فکس کرتا ہے۔ نام اور GitHub دریافت اور ماخذ رہتے ہیں۔"
   "Bundle" "بندل"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "تعریفات، Wasm آرٹیفیکٹس، اور compile receipts کو ایک ریلیز CID کے تحت بند کریں۔"
   "Replicate" "نقل کریں"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "ایک ہی مکمل closure کو کم از کم دو آزاد ذخیرہ مقامات پر محفوظ کریں۔"
   "Verify + Run" "تصدیق + چلائیں"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "ہر بائٹ اور routed peer IDs کی تصدیق کریں، پھر ریلیز CID کے ذریعے عمل درآمد کریں اور برآمد کریں۔"
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Post-quantum دستخط لازمی ہیں، اختیاری نہیں۔ اشاعت کے لیے Passkey سیشن اور ML-DSA-65 دستخط جو Principal سے منسلک ہو، دونوں ضروری ہیں۔ بیرونی مستند کنندگان اور تقسیم شدہ اہلیت الگ سے تصدیق شدہ حدود رہتی ہیں۔"
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "لائبریری کیٹلاگ اور انحصار گراف کھولیں"
   "Approve library publication" "لائبریری کی اشاعت کی منظوری دیں"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI نے اس گراف پر مقامی طور پر دستخط کیے اور اسے Kotobase میں محفوظ کیا۔ شائع کرنے سے پہلے CIDs اور IPNS نام کی تصدیق کریں۔"
   "Namespace" "Namespace"
   "Release CID" "ریلیز CID"
   "Head record CID" "Head record CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS نام"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Passkey + ML-DSA-65 کے ساتھ شائع کریں"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "پوسٹ-کوانٹم کلید کی منتقلی کی منظوری دیں"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "عمل، ایپوک، موجودہ کلید، اور اگلی کلید کی تصدیق کریں۔ گردش دونوں ML-DSA کلیدوں سے دستخط شدہ ہوتی ہے اور صرف Passkey کی تصدیق کے بعد مؤثر ہوتی ہے۔"
   "Action" "عمل"
   "Expected epoch" "متوقع ایپوک"
   "Current key" "موجودہ کلید"
   "Next key" "اگلی کلید"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Passkey کے ساتھ کلید کی منتقلی کی تصدیق کریں"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "AI-لکھے گئے کوڈ سے قبول شدہ حساب تک"
   "Write" "لکھیں"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "ایجنٹس اور انسان پڑھنے کے قابل، ڈیٹا پر مبنی کوڈ میں آزادانہ طور پر لکھتے ہیں۔"
   "Admit" "قبول کریں"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba اقسام، اثرات، صلاحیتیں، وسائل، اور ہدف کی حمایت چیک کرتا ہے۔"
   "Bind" "باندھیں"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "میزبان اور فراہم کنندہ Passkey شناخت اور ایک وسائل پر مبنی گرانٹ کو باندھتے ہیں۔"
   "Run" "چلائیں"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase آرٹیفیکٹس اور رسیدیں رکھتا ہے؛ Murakumo اور Itonami قبول شدہ کام انجام دیتے ہیں۔"
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "حدود کنکشن کو ممکن بناتی ہیں۔"
   "Discovery is not delegation" "دریافت تفویض نہیں ہے"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud ہر ماخذ کو دریافت کے قابل بناتا ہے بغیر اسٹوریج، کمپیوٹ، اور ایجنٹ کے کام کو ایک اعتماد کے دائرے میں ضم کیے۔ رسیدیں ہر ماخذ کو الگ الگ ریکارڈ کرتی ہیں۔"
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "موجودہ auth.kotobase.net Passkeys خودکار طور پر منتقل نہیں ہوتے۔ نیا RP ایک تصدیق شدہ Principal لنک کا تقاضا کرتا ہے۔"
   "Machine-readable profile" "مشین-قابلِ پڑھائی پروفائل"
   "Read the language specification" "زبان کی وضاحت پڑھیں"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — شناخت اور تعیناتی کنٹرول"
   "LLM docs" "LLM دستاویزات"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "زبان: kotoba-lang.org · اسٹوریج: kotobase.net · کمپیوٹ: murakumo.cloud · ایجنٹ کا کام: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "آپریٹر: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "رابطہ:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "آپریٹر"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "مخصوص تجارتی لین دین کا نوٹس"}
  :pcm {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — execution wey dey under control for software wey AI write"
   "Skip to content" "Skip to content"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Architecture"
   "Publish libraries" "Publish libraries"
   "Language" "Language"
   "English" "English"
   "Español" "Español"
   "Français" "Français"
   "Português" "Português"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "Bahasa Indonesia"
   "Deutsch" "Deutsch"
   "Naijá" "Naijá"
   "Sign in" "Sign in"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "CONTROLLED EXECUTION"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Execution wey dey under control for software wey AI write."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud na di identity and deploy-control entrance to di execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba na di language. Kotobase na di trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs dey build towards safe and ultra-fast software stack wey connect all three."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Start with Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Check Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "AI agent quickstart"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery and the Passkey RP dey live. Hosted apply no dey available yet."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "PASSKEY USERNAME"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "STABLE PRINCIPAL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "ACTIVE CONTROLLER"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Three places wey work dey run. Their boundaries still dey."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Di services connect without become one giant trust domain. Each authority still dey separately governed."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "CONTROL + IDENTITY"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey dey verify Stable Principal. Di control plane dey publish di topology and authority floor wey CLI deploy dey use."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "STORAGE"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Na content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "Connect this Principal →"
   "COMPUTE" "COMPUTE"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "E dey place admitted workloads for CPU/GPU resources and e dey execute dem."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "AGENT WORK"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "E dey run continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "One release CID wey you fit run from different providers"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "One release CID dey fix di namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence inside one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub still remain discovery and provenance."
   "Bundle" "Bundle"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Put definitions, Wasm artifacts and compile receipts together under one release CID."
   "Replicate" "Replicate"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Store di same complete closure for no less than two independent storage origins."
   "Verify + Run" "Verify + Run"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Check every byte and routed peer IDs, then use di release CID and export take run am."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Post-quantum signatures na mandatory, no be optional. Publication need both Passkey session and ML-DSA-65 signature wey pin to di Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification still dey separately verified boundaries."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Open di library catalog and dependency graph"
   "Approve library publication" "Approve library publication"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "Di CLI sign this graph locally and store am for Kotobase. Verify di CIDs and IPNS name before you publish."
   "Namespace" "Namespace"
   "Release CID" "Release CID"
   "Head record CID" "Head record CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS name"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Publish wit Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Approve di change of post-quantum key"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Verify di action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation na signed by both ML-DSA keys and e go start only after Passkey confirmation."
   "Action" "Action"
   "Expected epoch" "Expected epoch"
   "Current key" "Current key"
   "Next key" "Next key"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Confirm key transition wit Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "From AI-written code go admitted computation"
   "Write" "Write"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agents and humans dey write freely for readable, data-oriented code."
   "Admit" "Admit"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba dey check types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support."
   "Bind" "Bind"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Di host and provider dey bind Passkey identity and resource-scoped grant."
   "Run" "Run"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase dey keep artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami dey perform di admitted work."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Boundaries dey make connection possible."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Discovery no be delegation"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud dey make each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts dey record every origin separately."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys no dey migrate automatically. Di new RP need verified Principal link."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Machine-readable profile"
   "Read the language specification" "Read di language specification"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — identity and control for deployment"
