  :mr {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — AI-निर्मित सॉफ्टवेअर साठी नियंत्रित अंमलबजावणी"
   "Skip to content" "सामग्रीकडे थेट जा"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "आर्किटेक्चर"
   "Publish libraries" "लायब्ररी प्रकाशित करा"
   "Language" "भाषा"
   "English" "इंग्रजी"
   "Español" "स्पॅनिश"
   "Français" "फ्रेंच"
   "Português" "पोर्तुगीज"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "बहासा इंडोनेशिया"
   "Deutsch" "जर्मन"
   "Naijá" "नायजेरियन"
   "Sign in" "साइन इन करा"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "नियंत्रित अंमलबजावणी"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "AI-निर्मित सॉफ्टवेअर साठी नियंत्रित अंमलबजावणी."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud हा AI-निर्मित सॉफ्टवेअरच्या अंमलबजावणी वातावरणासाठी ओळख आणि तैनात-नियंत्रण प्रवेशद्वार आहे. Kotoba ही भाषा आहे. Kotobase हा विश्वासार्ह ग्राफ स्थिती स्तर आहे. सुरक्षित कोड. विश्वासार्ह स्थिती. नियंत्रित अंमलबजावणी. Kotoba Labs सुरक्षित आणि अतिशय जलद सॉफ्टवेअर स्टॅक तयार करत आहे जो या तीनही गोष्टी जोडतो."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Base Account सह प्रारंभ करा"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Kotoba CLI एक्सप्लोर करा"
   "AI agent quickstart" "AI एजंट जलद प्रारंभ"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "डिस्कव्हरी आणि Passkey RP सक्रिय आहेत. होस्टेड अर्ज अद्याप उपलब्ध नाही."
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "PASSKEY वापरकर्तानाव"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "स्थिर Principal"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "सक्रिय नियंत्रक"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "तीन अंमलबजावणी स्तर. सीमा अखंड."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "सेवा एकत्र एक मोठ्या विश्वास क्षेत्रात न बदलता जोडल्या जातात. प्रत्येक अधिकार स्वतंत्रपणे शासित राहतो."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "नियंत्रण + ओळख"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey स्थिर Principal ची पडताळणी करतो. नियंत्रण स्तर CLI तैनातीसाठी वापरलेली टोपोलॉजी आणि अधिकार मजला प्रकाशित करतो."
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "साठवण"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "AI स्थिती आणि ज्ञानासाठी एक सामग्री-आधारित ग्राफ डेटाबेस, ज्यात स्पष्ट संबंध आणि ओळखण्याजोगा इतिहास आहे."
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "हा Principal कनेक्ट करा →"
   "COMPUTE" "गणना"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "CPU/GPU संसाधनांवर मान्यताप्राप्त कार्यभार ठेवतो आणि त्यांची अंमलबजावणी करतो."
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "एजंट कार्य"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "कार्यस्थान, उद्दिष्टे, साधने आणि मंजुरींमध्ये सतत एजंट कार्य चालवतो."
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "एकच प्रकाशन CID, अनेक प्रदात्यांकडून चालवण्यायोग्य"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "एक प्रकाशन CID namespace हेड, व्याख्या, कच्चा Wasm, संकलन पावती आणि पुनरुत्पादकता पुरावा एका IPLD ग्राफमध्ये निश्चित करतो. नावे आणि GitHub डिस्कव्हरी आणि उत्पत्ती म्हणून राहतात."
   "Bundle" "बंडल"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "एकाच प्रकाशन CID अंतर्गत व्याख्या, Wasm घटक आणि संकलन पावती बंद करा."
   "Replicate" "प्रतिध्वनी"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "किमान दोन स्वतंत्र साठवण स्रोतांवर एकसारखी पूर्ण क्लोजर साठवा."
   "Verify + Run" "पडताळणी + चालवा"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "प्रत्येक बाइट आणि मार्गदर्शित पीअर आयडीची पडताळणी करा, नंतर प्रकाशन CID द्वारे अंमलबजावणी करा आणि निर्यात करा."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "पोस्ट-क्वांटम स्वाक्षऱ्या अनिवार्य आहेत, पर्यायी नाहीत. प्रकाशनासाठी Passkey सत्र आणि Principal शी जोडलेली ML-DSA-65 स्वाक्षरी आवश्यक आहे. बाह्य प्रमाणीकरणकर्ता आणि वितरित पात्रता स्वतंत्रपणे पडताळलेले सीमा राहतात."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "लायब्ररी कॅटलॉग आणि अवलंबित्व ग्राफ उघडा"
   "Approve library publication" "लायब्ररी प्रकाशन मंजूर करा"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI ने हा ग्राफ स्थानिकपणे स्वाक्षरी केला आणि Kotobase मध्ये साठवला. प्रकाशनापूर्वी CID आणि IPNS नाव पडताळा."
   "Namespace" "Namespace"
   "Release CID" "प्रकाशन CID"
   "Head record CID" "हेड रेकॉर्ड CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS नाव"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Passkey + ML-DSA-65 सह प्रकाशित करा"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "पोस्ट-क्वांटम की संक्रमण मंजूर करा"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "क्रिया, युग, वर्तमान की आणि पुढील की तपासा. फिरवणे दोन्ही ML-DSA कींनी स्वाक्षरी केले जाते आणि फक्त Passkey पुष्टीकरणानंतर प्रभावी होते."
   "Action" "क्रिया"
   "Expected epoch" "अपेक्षित युग"
   "Current key" "सध्याची की"
   "Next key" "पुढील की"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Passkey सह की संक्रमण पुष्टी करा"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "AI-लेखित कोडपासून मान्यताप्राप्त संगणना पर्यंत"
   "Write" "लिहा"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "एजंट आणि माणसे वाचनीय, डेटा-केंद्रित कोडमध्ये मोकळेपणाने लिहितात."
   "Admit" "मान्य करा"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba प्रकार, परिणाम, क्षमता, संसाधने आणि लक्ष्य समर्थन तपासते."
   "Bind" "बांधा"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "होस्ट आणि प्रदाता Passkey ओळख आणि संसाधन-सीमित अनुदान बांधतात."
   "Run" "चालवा"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase कलाकृती आणि पावत्या ठेवते; Murakumo आणि Itonami मान्यताप्राप्त काम करतात."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "सीमा कनेक्शन शक्य करतात."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "शोध हा प्रतिनिधित्व नाही"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud प्रत्येक मूळ शोधण्याजोगे बनवते ज्यामुळे संग्रहण, संगणन आणि एजंट काम एका विश्वास डोमेनमध्ये विलीन होत नाही. पावत्या प्रत्येक मूळ स्वतंत्रपणे नोंदवतात."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "विद्यमान auth.kotobase.net Passkeys आपोआप स्थलांतरित होत नाहीत. नवीन RP ला सत्यापित Principal लिंक आवश्यक आहे."
   "Machine-readable profile" "मशीन-वाचनीय प्रोफाइल"
   "Read the language specification" "भाषा तपशील वाचा"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — ओळख आणि तैनात नियंत्रण"
   "LLM docs" "LLM दस्तऐवज"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "भाषा: kotoba-lang.org · संग्रहण: kotobase.net · संगणन: murakumo.cloud · एजंट काम: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "ऑपरेटर: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "संपर्क:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "ऑपरेटर"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "निर्दिष्ट व्यावसायिक व्यवहार सूचना"}
  :bn {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — AI-উৎপাদিত সফটওয়্যারের জন্য নিয়ন্ত্রিত কার্যকরী"
   "Skip to content" "বিষয়ে সরাসরি যান"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "স্থাপত্য"
   "Publish libraries" "লাইব্রেরি প্রকাশ করুন"
   "Language" "ভাষা"
   "English" "ইংরেজি"
   "Español" "স্প্যানিশ"
   "Français" "ফরাসি"
   "Português" "পর্তুগিজ"
   "Bahasa Indonesia" "বাহাসা ইন্দোনেশিয়া"
   "Deutsch" "জার্মান"
   "Naijá" "নাইজা"
   "Sign in" "সাইন ইন করুন"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "নিয়ন্ত্রিত কার্যকরী"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "AI-উৎপাদিত সফটওয়্যারের জন্য নিয়ন্ত্রিত কার্যকরী।"
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud হল AI-উৎপাদিত সফটওয়্যারের কার্যকরী পরিবেশের জন্য পরিচয় এবং নিয়ন্ত্রণ-প্রবেশদ্বার। Kotoba হল ভাষা। Kotobase হল বিশ্বাসযোগ্য গ্রাফ স্টেট স্তর। নিরাপদ কোড। বিশ্বাসযোগ্য অবস্থা। নিয়ন্ত্রিত কার্যকরী। Kotoba Labs একটি নিরাপদ এবং অতিদ্রুত সফটওয়্যার স্ট্যাক নির্মাণ করছে যা এই তিনটি সংযুক্ত করে।"
   "Start with a Base Account" "একটি Base Account দিয়ে শুরু করুন"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Kotoba CLI অন্বেষণ করুন"
   "AI agent quickstart" "AI এজেন্ট দ্রুত শুরু"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Discovery এবং Passkey RP লাইভ আছে। হোস্টেড অ্যাপ্লাই এখনও উপলব্ধ নয়।"
   "PASSKEY USERNAME" "PASSKEY ব্যবহারকারীর নাম"
   "@kotoba-…" "@kotoba-…"
   "STABLE PRINCIPAL" "STABLE PRINCIPAL"
   "ACTIVE CONTROLLER" "ACTIVE CONTROLLER"
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "তিনটি কার্যকরী প্লেন। সীমানা অক্ষুণ্ণ।"
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "সেবাগুলো একত্রিত হয়ে একটি বিশাল বিশ্বাস ডোমেইনে পরিণত হয় না। প্রতিটি কর্তৃপক্ষ আলাদাভাবে শাসিত থাকে।"
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "নিয়ন্ত্রণ + পরিচয়"
   "Kotoba Cloud" "Kotoba Cloud"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey একটি Stable Principal যাচাই করে। নিয়ন্ত্রণ প্লেন CLI deploy দ্বারা ব্যবহৃত টপোলজি এবং কর্তৃপক্ষের স্তর প্রকাশ করে।"
   "auth.kotoba.cloud" "auth.kotoba.cloud"
   "·  api.kotoba.cloud" "·  api.kotoba.cloud"
   "STORAGE" "স্টোরেজ"
   "Kotobase" "Kotobase"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "AI অবস্থা এবং জ্ঞানের জন্য একটি বিষয়বস্তু-ঠিকানাযুক্ত গ্রাফ ডাটাবেস, স্পষ্ট সম্পর্ক এবং সনাক্তযোগ্য ইতিহাস সহ।"
   "kotobase.net ↗" "kotobase.net ↗"
   "Connect this Principal →" "এই Principal সংযুক্ত করুন →"
   "COMPUTE" "কম্পিউট"
   "Murakumo" "Murakumo"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "CPU/GPU সম্পদে অনুমোদিত ওয়ার্কলোড স্থাপন করে এবং সেগুলো কার্যকর করে।"
   "murakumo.cloud ↗" "murakumo.cloud ↗"
   "AGENT WORK" "এজেন্ট কাজ"
   "Itonami" "Itonami"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "ওয়ার্কস্পেস, লক্ষ্য, সরঞ্জাম এবং অনুমোদনের মধ্যে চলমান এজেন্ট কাজ চালায়।"
   "itonami.cloud ↗" "itonami.cloud ↗"
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "একটি রিলিজ CID, একাধিক প্রদানকারীর থেকে কার্যকর"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "একটি রিলিজ CID একটি IPLD গ্রাফে namespace head, সংজ্ঞা, কাঁচা Wasm, কম্পাইল রসিদ এবং পুনরুত্পাদনযোগ্যতার প্রমাণ নির্দিষ্ট করে। নাম এবং GitHub আবিষ্কার এবং উৎস হিসেবে থাকে।"
   "Bundle" "বাণ্ডেল"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "একটি রিলিজ CID এর অধীনে সংজ্ঞা, Wasm আর্টিফ্যাক্ট এবং কম্পাইল রসিদ বন্ধ করুন।"
   "Replicate" "প্রতিলিপি করুন"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "একই সম্পূর্ণ ক্লোজার কমপক্ষে দুইটি স্বাধীন স্টোরেজ উৎসে সংরক্ষণ করুন।"
   "Verify + Run" "যাচাই + চালান"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "প্রতিটি বাইট এবং রাউটেড পিয়ার আইডি যাচাই করুন, তারপর রিলিজ CID দ্বারা কার্যকর করুন এবং রপ্তানি করুন।"
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "পোস্ট-কোয়ান্টাম স্বাক্ষর বাধ্যতামূলক, ঐচ্ছিক নয়। প্রকাশনার জন্য Passkey সেশন এবং Principal-এ পিন করা ML-DSA-65 স্বাক্ষর উভয়ই প্রয়োজন। বাহ্যিক প্রমাণীকরণকারী এবং বিতরণকৃত যোগ্যতা আলাদাভাবে যাচাইকৃত সীমানা হিসেবে থাকে।"
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "লাইব্রেরি ক্যাটালগ এবং নির্ভরতা গ্রাফ খুলুন"
   "Approve library publication" "লাইব্রেরি প্রকাশ অনুমোদন করুন"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI এই গ্রাফটি স্থানীয়ভাবে স্বাক্ষর করেছে এবং Kotobase-এ সংরক্ষণ করেছে। প্রকাশের আগে CID এবং IPNS নাম যাচাই করুন।"
   "Namespace" "নেমস্পেস"
   "Release CID" "রিলিজ CID"
   "Head record CID" "হেড রেকর্ড CID"
   "IPNS name" "IPNS নাম"
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Passkey + ML-DSA-65 দিয়ে প্রকাশ করুন"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "পোস্ট-কোয়ান্টাম কী ট্রানজিশন অনুমোদন করুন"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "কার্য, যুগ, বর্তমান কী এবং পরবর্তী কী যাচাই করুন। রোটেশন উভয় ML-DSA কী দ্বারা স্বাক্ষরিত হয় এবং শুধুমাত্র Passkey নিশ্চিতকরণের পরে কার্যকর হয়।"
   "Action" "কর্ম"
   "Expected epoch" "প্রত্যাশিত যুগ"
   "Current key" "বর্তমান কী"
   "Next key" "পরবর্তী কী"
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Passkey দিয়ে কী ট্রানজিশন নিশ্চিত করুন"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "AI-লিখিত কোড থেকে অনুমোদিত গণনায়"
   "Write" "লিখুন"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "এজেন্ট এবং মানুষ পড়ার যোগ্য, ডেটা-কেন্দ্রিক কোডে স্বাধীনভাবে লিখে।"
   "Admit" "অনুমোদন করুন"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba টাইপ, প্রভাব, ক্ষমতা, সম্পদ এবং লক্ষ্য সমর্থন পরীক্ষা করে।"
   "Bind" "বাইন্ড করুন"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "হোস্ট এবং প্রদানকারী Passkey পরিচয় এবং একটি সম্পদ-সীমাবদ্ধ গ্রান্ট বাইন্ড করে।"
   "Run" "চালান"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase আর্টিফ্যাক্ট এবং রসিদ রাখে; Murakumo এবং Itonami অনুমোদিত কাজ সম্পাদন করে।"
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "সীমাবদ্ধতাগুলো সংযোগ সম্ভব করে।"
   "Discovery is not delegation" "আবিষ্কারকরণ প্রতিনিধিত্ব নয়"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud প্রতিটি উৎসকে আবিষ্কারের যোগ্য করে তোলে, স্টোরেজ, কম্পিউট এবং এজেন্ট কাজ একক ট্রাস্ট ডোমেইনে মিশ্রিত না করে। রসিদ প্রতিটি উৎস আলাদাভাবে রেকর্ড করে।"
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "বিদ্যমান auth.kotobase.net Passkey স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে স্থানান্তরিত হয় না। নতুন RP একটি যাচাইকৃত Principal লিঙ্ক প্রয়োজন।"
   "Machine-readable profile" "মেশিন-পাঠযোগ্য প্রোফাইল"
   "Read the language specification" "ভাষা স্পেসিফিকেশন পড়ুন"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — পরিচয় এবং ডিপ্লয় নিয়ন্ত্রণ"
   "LLM docs" "LLM ডকুমেন্টস"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "ভাষা: kotoba-lang.org · স্টোরেজ: kotobase.net · কম্পিউট: murakumo.cloud · এজেন্ট কাজ: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "অপারেটর: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "যোগাযোগ:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "অপারেটর"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "নির্দিষ্ট বাণিজ্যিক লেনদেন বিজ্ঞপ্তি"}
  :jv {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — eksekusi kang dikendhalèni kanggo piranti alus gawéan AI"
   "Skip to content" "Lompat menyang kontèn"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Arsitektur"
   "Publish libraries" "Terbitaké pustaka"
   "Language" "Basa"
   "Sign in" "Mlebu"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "EKSEKUSI KANG DIKENDHALÈNI"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Eksekusi kang dikendhalèni kanggo piranti alus gawéan AI."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud iku lawang identitas lan kontrol panerapan menyang lingkungan eksekusi piranti alus gawéan AI. Kotoba iku basané. Kotobase iku lapisan status graf kang bisa dipercaya. Kode aman. Status kang bisa dipercaya. Eksekusi kang dikendhalèni. Kotoba Labs mbangun tumpukan piranti alus kang aman lan banter kang nyambungaké keteluné."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Miwiti nganggo Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Deleng Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Wiwitan cepet agèn AI"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Panemuan lan Passkey RP wis mlaku. Hosted apply durung kasedhiya."
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Telung bidang eksekusi. Wates tetep."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Layanan nyambung tanpa dadi siji domain kapercayan gedhé. Saben wewenang tetep diatur kapisah."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "KONTROL + IDENTITAS"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey verifikasi Stable Principal. Bidang kontrol nerbitaké topologi lan lantai wewenang kang dienggo CLI deploy."
   "STORAGE" "PANYIMPENAN"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Basis data graf kanthi alamat kontèn kanggo status lan kawruh AI, kanthi relasi cetha lan riwayat kang bisa dikenal."
   "COMPUTE" "KOMPUTASI"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Ngonfigurasi beban kerja kang diakoni ing sumber CPU/GPU lan nglakokaké."
   "AGENT WORK" "PAGAWéAN AGèN"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Nglakokaké pagawéan agèn kang terus ing workspace, goal, piranti, lan persetujuan."
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Siji release CID, bisa dilakokaké saka pirang-pirang panedhiya"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "Release CID ngunci namespace head, definisi, Wasm mentah, kuitansi kompilasi, lan bukti reproduksi ing siji graf IPLD. Jeneng lan GitHub tetep kanggo panemuan lan asal-usul."
   "Bundle" "Bundel"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Tutup definisi, artefak Wasm, lan kuitansi kompilasi ing siji release CID."
   "Replicate" "Replikasi"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Simpen closure kang padha ing ora kurang saka rong asal panyimpenan mandiri."
   "Verify + Run" "Verifikasi + Lakokaké"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Verifikasi saben bita lan ID peer kang dialihaké, banjur lakokaké miturut release CID lan ekspor."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Tandha post-quantum iku wajib, dudu pilihan. Publikasi mbutuhaké session Passkey lan tandha ML-DSA-65 kang dipin ing Principal. Authenticator njaba lan kualifikasi kasebar tetep wates kang diverifikasi kapisah."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Bukak katalog pustaka lan graf dependensi"
   "Approve library publication" "Setujoni publikasi pustaka"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI nandhatangani graf iki sacara lokal lan nyimpen ing Kotobase. Priksa CID lan jeneng IPNS sadurungé nerbitaké."
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Terbitaké nganggo Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Setujoni transisi kunci post-quantum"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Priksa action, epoch, kunci saiki, lan kunci sabanjuré. Rotasi ditandhatangani déning loro kunci ML-DSA lan mung berlaku sawisé konfirmasi Passkey."
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Konfirmasi transisi kunci nganggo Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "Saka kode tulisan AI menyang komputasi kang diakoni"
   "Write" "Tulis"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agèn lan manungsa nulis kanthi bébas ing kode kang bisa diwaca lan berorientasi data."
   "Admit" "Akoni"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba mriksa type, effect, capability, resource, lan dhukungan target."
   "Bind" "Ikat"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Host lan panedhiya ngikat identitas Passkey lan grant kanthi cakupan sumber."
   "Run" "Lakokaké"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase nyimpen artefak lan kuitansi; Murakumo lan Itonami nindakaké pagawéan kang diakoni."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Wates ndadèkaké sambungan bisa."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Panemuan dudu pendelegasian"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud ndadèkaké saben asal bisa ditemokaké tanpa nggabungaké panyimpenan, komputasi, lan pagawéan agèn dadi siji domain kapercayan. Kuitansi nyathet saben asal kapisah."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Passkey auth.kotobase.net kang wis ana ora pindhah otomatis. RP anyar mbutuhaké tautan Principal kang diverifikasi."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Profil kang bisa diwaca mesin"
   "Read the language specification" "Waca spésifikasi basa"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — identitas lan kontrol panerapan"
   "LLM docs" "Dokumèn LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Basa: kotoba-lang.org · Panyimpenan: kotobase.net · Komputasi: murakumo.cloud · Pagawéan agèn: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Kontak:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Operator"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Kabèr Transaksi Komersial Kanthi Ketentuan"}
  :su {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — éksekusi anu dikawasa pikeun parangkat lunak jieunan AI"
   "Skip to content" "Luncat ka eusi"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Arsitéktur"
   "Publish libraries" "Terbitkeun pustaka"
   "Language" "Basa"
   "Sign in" "Asup"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "ÉKSEKUSI ANU DIKAWASA"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Éksekusi anu dikawasa pikeun parangkat lunak jieunan AI."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud téh panto idéntitas jeung kontrol panyebaran ka lingkungan éksekusi parangkat lunak jieunan AI. Kotoba téh basana. Kotobase téh lapisan status graf anu tiasa dipercaya. Kode aman. Status anu tiasa dipercaya. Éksekusi anu dikawasa. Kotoba Labs ngawangun tumpukan parangkat lunak anu aman jeung gancang anu nyambungkeun tiluanana."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Mimitian ku Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Tingali Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Mimitian gancang agén AI"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Panemuan jeung Passkey RP geus jalan. Hosted apply tacan sayogi."
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Tilu widang éksekusi. Wates tetep."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "Layanan nyambung tanpa jadi hiji domain kapercayaan gedé. Unggal wenang tetep diatur misah."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "KONTROL + IDÉNTITAS"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey verifikasi Stable Principal. Widang kontrol medalkeun topologi jeung lantai wenang anu dipaké CLI deploy."
   "STORAGE" "PANYIMPENAN"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Basis data graf anu alamatna dumasar eusi pikeun status jeung pangaweruh AI, kalayan hubungan jelas jeung sajarah anu tiasa dikenal."
   "COMPUTE" "KOMPUTASI"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Nempatkeun beban gawé anu diakuan dina sumber CPU/GPU sarta ngajalankeun."
   "AGENT WORK" "PAGAWÉAN AGÉN"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Ngajalankeun pagawéan agén anu terus dina workspace, goal, parabot, jeung persetujuan."
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Hiji release CID, tiasa dijalankeun ti sababaraha panyadia"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "Release CID ngonci namespace head, definisi, Wasm atah, kuitansi kompilasi, jeung bukti réproduksi dina hiji graf IPLD. Ngaran jeung GitHub tetep pikeun panemuan jeung asal-usul."
   "Bundle" "Bundel"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Tutup definisi, artefak Wasm, jeung kuitansi kompilasi dina hiji release CID."
   "Replicate" "Réplikasi"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Simpen closure anu sarua di teu kurang ti dua asal panyimpenan mandiri."
   "Verify + Run" "Verifikasi + Jalankeun"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Verifikasi unggal bita jeung ID peer anu dialihkeun, tuluy jalankeun nurutkeun release CID jeung ékspor."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Tanda tangan post-quantum wajib, lain pilihan. Publikasi merlukeun session Passkey jeung tanda tangan ML-DSA-65 anu dipin kana Principal. Authenticator luar jeung kualifikasi sumebar tetep wates anu diverifikasi misah."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Buka katalog pustaka jeung graf dependensi"
   "Approve library publication" "Satujuan publikasi pustaka"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "CLI nandatanganan graf ieu sacara lokal sarta nyimpen di Kotobase. Pariksa CID jeung ngaran IPNS saméméh medalkeun."
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Terbitkeun ku Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Satujuan transisi konci post-quantum"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Pariksa action, epoch, konci ayeuna, jeung konci salajengna. Rotasi ditandatanganan ku dua konci ML-DSA sarta ngan lumaku sanggeus konfirmasi Passkey."
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Konfirmasi transisi konci ku Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "Tina kode tulisan AI ka komputasi anu diakuan"
   "Write" "Tulis"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agén jeung manusa nulis bébas dina kode anu tiasa dibaca sarta berorientasi data."
   "Admit" "Akuan"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba mariksa type, effect, capability, resource, jeung rojongan target."
   "Bind" "Iket"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Host jeung panyadia ngiket idéntitas Passkey jeung grant kalayan cakupan sumber."
   "Run" "Jalankeun"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase nyimpen artefak jeung kuitansi; Murakumo jeung Itonami ngalaksanakeun pagawéan anu diakuan."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "Wates ngajadikeun sambungan mungkin."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Panemuan lain pendelegasian"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud ngajadikeun unggal asal tiasa kapanggih tanpa ngahijikeun panyimpenan, komputasi, jeung pagawéan agén jadi hiji domain kapercayaan. Kuitansi nyatet unggal asal sacara misah."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Passkey auth.kotobase.net anu geus aya henteu pindah otomatis. RP anyar merlukeun tautan Principal anu diverifikasi."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Profil anu tiasa dibaca mesin"
   "Read the language specification" "Baca spésifikasi basa"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — idéntitas jeung kontrol panyebaran"
   "LLM docs" "Dokumén LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Basa: kotoba-lang.org · Panyimpenan: kotobase.net · Komputasi: murakumo.cloud · Pagawéan agén: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Kontak:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Operator"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Béwara Transaksi Komérsial Kalayan Katangtuan"}
  :he {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — הרצה מבוקרת לתוכנה שנוצרה בידי בינה מלאכותית"
   "Skip to content" "דלג לתוכן"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "ארכיטקטורה"
   "Publish libraries" "פרסום ספריות"
   "Language" "שפה"
   "Sign in" "כניסה"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "הרצה מבוקרת"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "הרצה מבוקרת לתוכנה שנוצרה בידי בינה מלאכותית."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud הוא פתח הזהות ובקרת הפריסה לסביבת ההרצה של תוכנה שנוצרה בידי בינה מלאכותית. Kotoba הוא השפה. Kotobase הוא שכבת מצב הגרף האמינה. קוד בטוח. מצב אמין. הרצה מבוקרת. Kotoba Labs בונה מחסנית תוכנה בטוחה ומהירה במיוחד שמחברת את שלושתן."
   "Start with a Base Account" "התחלה עם Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "עיון ב־Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "התחלה מהירה לסוכן AI"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "גילוי ו־Passkey RP פעילים. Hosted apply עדיין אינו זמין."
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "שלושה מישורי הרצה. הגבולות נשמרים."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "השירותים מתחברים בלי להפוך לתחום אמון אחד גדול. כל סמכות נשארת בניהול נפרד."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "בקרה + זהות"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey מאמת Stable Principal. מישור הבקרה מפרסם את הטופולוגיה ורצפת הסמכות שמשמשות את CLI deploy."
   "STORAGE" "אחסון"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "מסד נתוני גרף ממוען לפי תוכן למצב ולידע של בינה מלאכותית, עם קשרים מפורשים והיסטוריה ניתנת לזיהוי."
   "COMPUTE" "חישוב"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "ממקם עומסי עבודה שהתקבלו על משאבי CPU/GPU ומריץ אותם."
   "AGENT WORK" "עבודת סוכן"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "מריץ עבודת סוכן מתמשכת בין סביבות עבודה, יעדים, כלים ואישורים."
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "CID הפצה אחד, ניתן להרצה מכמה ספקים"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "CID הפצה מקבע את ראש מרחב השמות, ההגדרות, Wasm הגולמי, קבלות ההידור וראיות השחזור בגרף IPLD אחד. שמות ו־GitHub נשארים לגילוי ולמקור."
   "Bundle" "צרור"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "סגירת הגדרות, ארטיפקטים של Wasm וקבלות הידור תחת CID הפצה אחד."
   "Replicate" "שכפול"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "שמירת אותו סגירה מלאה בשני מקורות אחסון עצמאיים לפחות."
   "Verify + Run" "אימות + הרצה"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "אימות כל בית ומזהי עמית מנותבים, ואז הרצה לפי CID הפצה וייצוא."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "חתימות פוסט־קוונטיות הן חובה, לא רשות. פרסום דורש גם session של Passkey וגם חתימת ML-DSA-65 המעוגנת ל־Principal. מאמתים חיצוניים והסמכה מבוזרת נשארים גבולות מאומתים בנפרד."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "פתיחת קטלוג הספריות וגרף התלויות"
   "Approve library publication" "אישור פרסום ספרייה"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "ה־CLI חתם על הגרף הזה מקומית ושמר אותו ב־Kotobase. אמתו את ה־CID ואת שם ה־IPNS לפני הפרסום."
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "פרסום עם Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "אישור מעבר מפתח פוסט־קוונטי"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "אמתו את הפעולה, ה־epoch, המפתח הנוכחי והמפתח הבא. הסיבוב חתום בשני מפתחות ML-DSA ונכנס לתוקף רק אחרי אישור Passkey."
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "אישור מעבר מפתח עם Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "מקוד שנכתב בידי בינה מלאכותית לחישוב שהתקבל"
   "Write" "כתיבה"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "סוכנים ובני אדם כותבים בחופשיות בקוד קריא ומוכוון נתונים."
   "Admit" "קבלה"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba בודק types, effects, capabilities, resources ותמיכת יעד."
   "Bind" "קישור"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "המארח והספק קושרים זהות Passkey והרשאה בהיקף משאב."
   "Run" "הרצה"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase שומר ארטיפקטים וקבלות; Murakumo ו־Itonami מבצעים את העבודה שהתקבלה."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "גבולות מאפשרים חיבור."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "גילוי אינו האצלה"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud הופך כל מקור לגילוי בלי למזג אחסון, חישוב ועבודת סוכנים לתחום אמון אחד. קבלות רושמות כל מקור בנפרד."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "מפתחות Passkey קיימים של auth.kotobase.net אינם עוברים אוטומטית. ה־RP החדש דורש קישור Principal מאומת."
   "Machine-readable profile" "פרופיל קריא למכונה"
   "Read the language specification" "קריאת מפרט השפה"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — זהות ובקרת פריסה"
   "LLM docs" "מסמכי LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "שפה: kotoba-lang.org · אחסון: kotobase.net · חישוב: murakumo.cloud · עבודת סוכן: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "מפעיל: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "יצירת קשר:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "מפעיל"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "הודעת עסקאות מסחריות מוגדרות"}
  :it {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — esecuzione controllata per il software generato dall’IA"
   "Skip to content" "Vai al contenuto"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "Architettura"
   "Publish libraries" "Pubblica librerie"
   "Language" "Lingua"
   "Sign in" "Accedi"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "ESECUZIONE CONTROLLATA"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "Esecuzione controllata per il software generato dall’IA."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud è l’ingresso di identità e controllo del deployment verso l’ambiente di esecuzione del software generato dall’IA. Kotoba è il linguaggio. Kotobase è lo strato di stato di grafo affidabile. Codice sicuro. Stato affidabile. Esecuzione controllata. Kotoba Labs sta costruendo uno stack software sicuro e ultra-rapido che collega i tre."
   "Start with a Base Account" "Inizia con un Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "Esplora Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "Avvio rapido per agenti IA"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "Il discovery e il Passkey RP sono attivi. Hosted apply non è ancora disponibile."
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "Tre piani di esecuzione. Confini intatti."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "I servizi si collegano senza diventare un unico dominio di fiducia. Ogni autorità resta governata separatamente."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "CONTROLLO + IDENTITÀ"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey verifica uno Stable Principal. Il piano di controllo pubblica la topologia e il livello di autorità usati dal deploy CLI."
   "STORAGE" "ARCHIVIAZIONE"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "Un database a grafo indirizzato per contenuto per lo stato e la conoscenza dell’IA, con relazioni esplicite e cronologia identificabile."
   "COMPUTE" "CALCOLO"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "Colloca i carichi di lavoro ammessi su risorse CPU/GPU e li esegue."
   "AGENT WORK" "LAVORO AGENTE"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "Esegue il lavoro continuo degli agenti tra workspace, obiettivi, strumenti e approvazioni."
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "Un CID di rilascio, eseguibile da più provider"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "Un CID di rilascio fissa la testa del namespace, le definizioni, il Wasm grezzo, le ricevute di compilazione e le prove di riproducibilità in un grafo IPLD. Nomi e GitHub restano per la scoperta e la provenienza."
   "Bundle" "Pacchetto"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "Chiudere definizioni, artefatti Wasm e ricevute di compilazione sotto un CID di rilascio."
   "Replicate" "Replicare"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "Memorizzare la stessa chiusura completa in almeno due origini di archiviazione indipendenti."
   "Verify + Run" "Verifica + Esegui"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "Verificare ogni byte e gli ID peer instradati, poi eseguire per CID di rilascio ed esportare."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "Le firme post-quantistiche sono obbligatorie, non opzionali. La pubblicazione richiede sia una session Passkey sia una firma ML-DSA-65 ancorata al Principal. Autenticatori esterni e qualificazione distribuita restano confini verificati separatamente."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "Apri il catalogo delle librerie e il grafo delle dipendenze"
   "Approve library publication" "Approva la pubblicazione della libreria"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "La CLI ha firmato questo grafo in locale e lo ha salvato in Kotobase. Verifica i CID e il nome IPNS prima di pubblicare."
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "Pubblica con Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "Approva la transizione della chiave post-quantistica"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "Verifica azione, epoch, chiave attuale e chiave successiva. La rotazione è firmata da entrambe le chiavi ML-DSA e ha effetto solo dopo la conferma Passkey."
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "Conferma la transizione della chiave con Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "Dal codice scritto dall’IA al calcolo ammesso"
   "Write" "Scrivere"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "Agenti e esseri umani scrivono liberamente in codice leggibile e orientato ai dati."
   "Admit" "Ammettere"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba controlla tipi, effetti, capacità, risorse e supporto del target."
   "Bind" "Vincolare"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "Host e provider legano l’identità Passkey e una concessione con ambito di risorsa."
   "Run" "Eseguire"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase conserva artefatti e ricevute; Murakumo e Itonami eseguono il lavoro ammesso."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "I confini rendono possibile la connessione."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "Scoprire non è delegare"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud rende ogni origine scopribile senza unire archiviazione, calcolo e lavoro degli agenti in un solo dominio di fiducia. Le ricevute registrano ogni origine separatamente."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "Le Passkey esistenti di auth.kotobase.net non migrano automaticamente. Il nuovo RP richiede un vincolo Principal verificato."
   "Machine-readable profile" "Profilo leggibile da macchina"
   "Read the language specification" "Leggi la specifica del linguaggio"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — identità e controllo del deployment"
   "LLM docs" "Documenti LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "Linguaggio: kotoba-lang.org · Archiviazione: kotobase.net · Calcolo: murakumo.cloud · Lavoro agente: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "Operatore: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "Contatto:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "Operatore"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "Avviso sulle transazioni commerciali specificate"}
  :ar-MA {"Kotoba Cloud — controlled execution for AI-generated software" "Kotoba Cloud — تنفيذ مضبوط للبرامج اللي كيكتبها الذكاء الاصطناعي"
   "Skip to content" "سير للمحتوى"
   "KOTOBA CLOUD" "KOTOBA CLOUD"
   "Architecture" "البنية"
   "Publish libraries" "نشر المكتبات"
   "Language" "اللغة"
   "Sign in" "تسجيل الدخول"
   "CONTROLLED EXECUTION" "تنفيذ مضبوط"
   "Controlled execution for AI-generated software." "تنفيذ مضبوط للبرامج اللي كيكتبها الذكاء الاصطناعي."
   "Kotoba Cloud is the identity and deploy-control entrance to the execution environment for AI-generated software. Kotoba is the language. Kotobase is the trusted graph state layer. Safe code. Trusted state. Controlled execution. Kotoba Labs is building toward a safe and ultra-fast software stack that connects all three." "Kotoba Cloud هو مدخل الهوية والتحكم فالنشر لبيئة تنفيذ البرامج اللي كيكتبها الذكاء الاصطناعي. Kotoba هي اللغة. Kotobase هي طبقة حالة الگراف الموثوقة. كود آمن. حالة موثوقة. تنفيذ مضبوط. Kotoba Labs كاتبني ستاك برمجيات آمن وسريع بزاف كيربط التلاتة."
   "Start with a Base Account" "بدا بـ Base Account"
   "Explore the Kotoba CLI" "شوف Kotoba CLI"
   "AI agent quickstart" "بداية سريعة لوكيل AI"
   "Discovery and the Passkey RP are live. Hosted apply is not available yet." "الاكتشاف وPasskey RP خدامين. Hosted apply مازال ماكاينش."
   "Three execution planes. Boundaries intact." "تلاتة ديال مستويات التنفيذ. الحدود باقا."
   "The services connect without becoming one giant trust domain. Each authority remains separately governed." "الخدمات كاترتابط بلا ما تولي دومين ثقة واحد كبير. كل سلطة كاتبقى مسيرة بوحدها."
   "CONTROL + IDENTITY" "التحكم + الهوية"
   "Passkey verifies a Stable Principal. The control plane publishes the topology and authority floor used by CLI deploy." "Passkey كيتأكد من Stable Principal. مستوى التحكم كينشر الطوبولوجيا وأرضية السلطة اللي كيستعمل CLI deploy."
   "STORAGE" "التخزين"
   "A content-addressed graph database for AI state and knowledge, with explicit relationships and identifiable history." "قاعدة بيانات گراف كتعطي عنوان حسب المحتوى لحالة الذكاء الاصطناعي ومعرفتو، مع علاقات واضحة وتاريخ تقدر تميّزو."
   "COMPUTE" "الحساب"
   "Places admitted workloads on CPU/GPU resources and executes them." "كاتحط أحمال العمل المقبولة على موارد CPU/GPU وكاتنفّذها."
   "AGENT WORK" "شغل الوكيل"
   "Runs continuing agent work across workspaces, goals, tools, and approvals." "كاتسيّر شغل الوكيل المستمر عبر مساحات العمل والأهداف والأدوات والموافقات."
   "One release CID, executable from multiple providers" "CID إصدار واحد، قابل للتنفيذ من عدة موفرين"
   "A release CID fixes the namespace head, definitions, raw Wasm, compile receipts, and reproducibility evidence in one IPLD graph. Names and GitHub remain discovery and provenance." "CID الإصدار كيثبّت رأس فضاء الأسماء والتعريفات وWasm الخام ووصولات التجميع وأدلة إعادة الإنتاج فگراف IPLD واحد. الأسماء وGitHub كيبقاو للاكتشاف والأصل."
   "Bundle" "حزمة"
   "Close definitions, Wasm artifacts, and compile receipts under one release CID." "سدّ التعريفات وأدوات Wasm ووصولات التجميع تحت CID إصدار واحد."
   "Replicate" "كرر"
   "Store the same complete closure at no fewer than two independent storage origins." "خزّن نفس الإغلاق الكامل فجوج مصادر تخزين مستقلة على الأقل."
   "Verify + Run" "تحقق + نفّذ"
   "Verify every byte and routed peer IDs, then execute by release CID and export." "تحقق من كل بايت ومعرّفات الأقران الموجّهة، ومن بعد نفّذ حسب CID الإصدار وصدّر."
   "Post-quantum signatures are mandatory, not optional. Publication requires both a Passkey session and an ML-DSA-65 signature pinned to the Principal. External authenticators and distributed qualification remain separately verified boundaries." "التوقيعات ما بعد الكم إلزامية، ماشي اختيارية. النشر كيتطلب session ديال Passkey وتوقيع ML-DSA-65 مثبت على Principal. المصادقات الخارجية والتأهيل الموزّع كيبقاو حدود متحقّق منها بوحدهم."
   "Open the library catalog and dependency graph" "افتح كتالوج المكتبات وگراف التبعيات"
   "Approve library publication" "وافق على نشر المكتبة"
   "The CLI signed this graph locally and stored it in Kotobase. Verify the CIDs and IPNS name before publishing." "الـ CLI وقّع هاد الگراف محلياً وخزّنو فـ Kotobase. تحقق من الـ CID وسمية IPNS قبل النشر."
   "Publish with Passkey + ML-DSA-65" "نشر بـ Passkey + ML-DSA-65"
   "Approve post-quantum key transition" "وافق على انتقال المفتاح ما بعد الكم"
   "Verify the action, epoch, current key, and next key. Rotation is signed by both ML-DSA keys and takes effect only after Passkey confirmation." "تحقق من الإجراء وepoch والمفتاح الحالي والمفتاح الجاي. الدوران موقّع بجوج مفاتيح ML-DSA وماكايطبّقش غير من بعد تأكيد Passkey."
   "Confirm key transition with Passkey" "أكّد انتقال المفتاح بـ Passkey"
   "From AI-written code to admitted computation" "من كود كتبو الذكاء الاصطناعي لحساب مقبول"
   "Write" "كتب"
   "Agents and humans write freely in readable, data-oriented code." "الوكلاء والبشر كايكتبو بحرية فكود مقروء وموجّه للمعطيات."
   "Admit" "اقبل"
   "Kotoba checks types, effects, capabilities, resources, and target support." "Kotoba كايتحقق من الأنواع والتأثيرات والقدرات والموارد ودعم الهدف."
   "Bind" "اربط"
   "The host and provider bind Passkey identity and a resource-scoped grant." "المضيف والموفّر كايربطو هوية Passkey ومنحة محدودة بالمورد."
   "Run" "نفّذ"
   "Kotobase keeps artifacts and receipts; Murakumo and Itonami perform the admitted work." "Kotobase كايحتفظ بالقطع والوصولات؛ Murakumo وItonami كاينفّذو الشغل المقبول."
   "Boundaries make connection possible." "الحدود هي اللي كاتخلّي الربط ممكن."
   "Discovery is not delegation" "الاكتشاف ماشي تفويض"
   "kotoba.cloud makes each origin discoverable without merging storage, compute, and agent work into one trust domain. Receipts record every origin separately." "kotoba.cloud كايخلّي كل أصل قابل للاكتشاف بلا ما يدمج التخزين والحساب وشغل الوكلاء فدومين ثقة واحد. الوصولات كاتسجّل كل أصل بوحدو."
   "Existing auth.kotobase.net Passkeys do not migrate automatically. The new RP requires a verified Principal link." "مفاتيح Passkey ديال auth.kotobase.net الموجودة ماكاتنتاقشش تلقائياً. الـ RP الجديد محتاج ربط Principal متحقّق منو."
   "Machine-readable profile" "ملف مقروء من الآلة"
   "Read the language specification" "قرا مواصفة اللغة"
   "Kotoba Cloud — identity and deploy control" "Kotoba Cloud — الهوية والتحكم فالنشر"
   "LLM docs" "وثائق LLM"
   "Language: kotoba-lang.org · Storage: kotobase.net · Compute: murakumo.cloud · Agent work: itonami.cloud" "اللغة: kotoba-lang.org · التخزين: kotobase.net · الحساب: murakumo.cloud · شغل الوكيل: itonami.cloud"
   "Operator: Kotoba Labs Inc" "المشغّل: Kotoba Labs Inc"
   "Contact:" "التواصل:"
   "support@kotoba.cloud" "support@kotoba.cloud"
   "Operator" "المشغّل"
   "Specified Commercial Transactions notice" "إشعار المعاملات التجارية المحددة"}})
